# agentd's deny-list: configurations B and D check every command line
# against it before anything runs, as a wrapper around a shell would.
#
#   word TEXT       no word of the line may contain TEXT
#   writes CMD ...  CMD changes the files it is given
#
# Whatever is written, by a command listed here or by > and >>, must be
# an absolute path inside the profile's scope, and the profile must have
# w at all.
word ..
word /dev/agent
writes rm mv mkdir
